{"nodes": [{"id": "handoff_context_handoff", "label": "PROCOVAR \u2014 Handoff de contexto", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "handoff_vps_infra", "label": "Infra del VPS 72.60.115.124 (PEDIDO docker + DELIVERY/ANALITICS systemd)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One shared VPS (also hosting ERPNext/n8n) runs all three apps; nginx on the host routes the pedidos/delivery/analitics subdomains and /api to the backends."}, {"id": "handoff_divergent_vps_secrets", "label": "Secretos divergentes en el VPS (working-tree no commiteado)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The VPS compose files and .env hold real inline secrets absent from the repo (which only has placeholders). They are uncommitted working-tree changes, so git clone/checkout/reset/stash destroys them: the next up -d starts the API with a placeholder JWT secret (invalidating sessions), with no shared service key (delivery gets 401) and without Redis. It already happened once. Recommended fix: move them to a gitignored .env referenced via env_file so git never touches them."}, {"id": "handoff_build_standalone_gotcha", "label": "BUILD_STANDALONE=1 obligatorio en el build de DELIVERY", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "systemd runs .next/standalone/server.js, and next.config emits output:'standalone' only when BUILD_STANDALONE=1. A plain npm run build deletes .next/standalone, so the unit fails on CHDIR/server.js and the site 502s."}, {"id": "handoff_customer_mirror", "label": "Mirror de clientes PEDIDO\u2192DELIVERY", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Delivery mirrors only geolocated PEDIDO clients (without coordinates there is no delivery cost to quote), auto-synced each worker cycle rather than by a manual button, so an order created from a route can pick a client and get a price immediately."}, {"id": "handoff_customer_source_externalid_pattern", "label": "Patr\u00f3n source/externalId/meta (Customer igual que Order)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reusing Order's shape \u2014 source ('pedido' vs null), externalId unique per [source, externalId] for idempotent upserts, and meta with the full payload \u2014 lets the sync delete stale mirrored rows without ever touching manually created local customers."}, {"id": "handoff_integration_clients_endpoint", "label": "GET /integration/clients (solo clientes con geo, x-api-key)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "handoff_sync_customers", "label": "syncCustomers() en sync-queue.mjs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Upserts the mirror every cycle and deletes rows that no longer come from PEDIDO, but never deletes on a failed fetch so a transient outage cannot wipe the mirror."}, {"id": "handoff_customer_picker", "label": "CustomerPicker en PedidoForm (routes/page.tsx)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "handoff_event_driven_no_polling", "label": "Arquitectura event-driven (sin polling) con colas in/out", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Explicit user requirement: delivery must not ask every 15s whether a new order exists; PEDIDO notifies on creation and delivery reacts. Bull queues are split by direction (in:* / out:*) so inbound and outbound flow in parallel."}, {"id": "handoff_enqueue_delivery_orders", "label": "enqueueDeliveryOrders() \u2192 cola procovar-delivery:in:orders", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "handoff_make_queue_generic", "label": "makeQueue() gen\u00e9rico + deliveryOrdersQueue() en queues.ts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "handoff_delivery_events_flag", "label": "Gate DELIVERY_EVENTS (despliegue inerte + rollback)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both slices shipped disabled: with the flag off nothing enqueues and delivery keeps the 15s poll, so the code could be deployed before cutover and rolled back by flipping one env var in both apps plus a restart."}, {"id": "handoff_safety_poll", "label": "SAFETY_POLL_MS (red de seguridad lenta, default 5min)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Even in event-driven mode a slow safety poll catches events lost while the worker was down; 0 disables it entirely."}, {"id": "handoff_redis_published_to_host", "label": "procovar-redis publicado en 127.0.0.1:6379 para delivery nativo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Delivery runs systemd-native on the host (no container), so the dockerized Redis had to bind 127.0.0.1:6379 for it to connect. Doing so also activated R4a/R5, which had silently been running in their no-Redis fallback."}, {"id": "handoff_sse_ticket", "label": "SSE autenticado por ticket ef\u00edmero (POST /orders/sse-ticket)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "EventSource cannot send headers, so the stream is authorized with a short-lived ticket in the query string instead of putting the JWT in the URL."}, {"id": "handoff_service_api_key", "label": "SERVICE_API_KEY compartida (header x-api-key)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Must be identical in the PEDIDO api and delivery's .env; if they diverge the delivery sync gets 401."}, {"id": "handoff_import_use_queue", "label": "IMPORT_USE_QUEUE=true requiere el worker corriendo", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "handoff_worker_service", "label": "Servicio procovar-worker (misma imagen, node dist/worker.js)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "handoff_geo_data_blocker", "label": "Bloqueo de datos: 0 de 115 clientes con geolocalizaci\u00f3n", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "handoff_currency_usd_cup", "label": "Moneda USD/CUP con useCurrency()", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Amounts are stored in USD as the single source of truth and only the display converts using Settings.cupRate; editable config inputs stay in USD because bidirectional conversion while editing introduces rounding problems."}, {"id": "handoff_sudo_whitelist", "label": "Whitelist de sudo de jose (ruta completa /usr/bin/systemctl)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The sudoers entries match absolute paths, so bare `sudo systemctl` prompts for a password; jose can restart the three units and run the pedido compose files, but not nginx, git in /root, or service creation."}, {"id": "handoff_supervisor_role", "label": "Rol Supervisor con vendedores + isGlobalAdmin consistente", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "With zero Gestores in the branch, 130 orders were invisible; letting Supervisor carry sellers plus fixing per-branch user filters restored visibility."}, {"id": "handoff_products_autosync_gap", "label": "Auto-sync de productos bloqueado (warehouse externo sin webhooks)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The warehouse is a third-party system with no webhooks, so products cannot be event-driven. It needs the devops owner to expose either a product-change webhook (ideal, making Product a global auto-updated mirror) or an updatedSince delta endpoint; otherwise only spaced pulls plus the 10-minute Redis cache."}, {"id": "handoff_out_queues_deferred", "label": "Colas out:* (Slice 3) diferidas a prop\u00f3sito", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Outbound already has a durable queue with retries (the SyncJob table plus MAX_ATTEMPTS), so splitting out:quote / out:writeback into Bull adds little and risks the hot path."}, {"id": "handoff_dockerize_delivery_option", "label": "Dockerizar delivery (opcional, systemd\u2192docker)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Requested for consistency with pedido, but the container would need to reach native Postgres :5432, the warehouse VPN (10.188.x) and the api :8400 \u2014 likely network_mode: host. Not required for correctness, and jose has no compose whitelist for delivery."}], "edges": [{"source": "handoff_context_handoff", "target": "runbook_procovar_runbook", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_context_handoff", "target": "redis_rollout_plan", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_context_handoff", "target": "handoff_vps_infra", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_divergent_vps_secrets", "target": "api_docker_compose_api", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_divergent_vps_secrets", "target": "handoff_service_api_key", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_divergent_vps_secrets", "target": "deploy_vps_docker_compose_pedido_api", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_worker_service", "target": "handoff_import_use_queue", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_customer_mirror", "target": "handoff_integration_clients_endpoint", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_sync_customers", "target": "handoff_integration_clients_endpoint", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_sync_customers", "target": "handoff_customer_mirror", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_customer_source_externalid_pattern", "target": "handoff_customer_mirror", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_customer_picker", "target": "handoff_customer_mirror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_geo_data_blocker", "target": "handoff_customer_mirror", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_geo_data_blocker", "target": "deploy_local_deploy_local_sucursal_backfill", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_enqueue_delivery_orders", "target": "handoff_event_driven_no_polling", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_enqueue_delivery_orders", "target": "handoff_make_queue_generic", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_delivery_events_flag", "target": "handoff_enqueue_delivery_orders", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_safety_poll", "target": "handoff_event_driven_no_polling", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_redis_published_to_host", "target": "handoff_event_driven_no_polling", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_redis_published_to_host", "target": "handoff_dockerize_delivery_option", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_build_standalone_gotcha", "target": "deploy_vps_docker_compose_delivery", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_build_standalone_gotcha", "target": "deploy_local_deploy_local_standalone_warning", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_sse_ticket", "target": "redis_rollout_slice1_sse_pubsub", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_service_api_key", "target": "deploy_local_deploy_local_cost_flow", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_sudo_whitelist", "target": "runbook_procovar_sudo_nopasswd", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_out_queues_deferred", "target": "deploy_local_deploy_local_syncjob_queue", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_products_autosync_gap", "target": "deploy_local_deploy_local_warehouse_weights", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_products_autosync_gap", "target": "redis_rollout_slice5_weights_cache", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_vps_infra", "target": "front_docker_compose_front", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_vps_infra", "target": "runbook_procovar_hosts", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_supervisor_role", "target": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_sucursal_isolation", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "handoff_currency_usd_cup", "target": "deploy_local_deploy_local_cost_flow", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "event_driven_cutover_flow", "label": "Cutover event-driven PEDIDO\u2192DELIVERY (enqueue, gate, red de seguridad, Redis en el host)", "nodes": ["handoff_event_driven_no_polling", "handoff_enqueue_delivery_orders", "handoff_delivery_events_flag", "handoff_safety_poll", "handoff_redis_published_to_host", "handoff_make_queue_generic"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "HANDOFF.md"}]}